     "integrity": "sha512-HDwqVDIdZblNHucutimGrPHR9eYmQnVU43cq6JJ4XgQYGkPBSR8rr1uCSEihsNaDm7k3JVgeqOxrMR50nQBzxQ==",
     "shasum": "dba502be5db75c5f727ded93e423039ec6aec870",
     "signatures": [
